{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117552","id":3413859710,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Le11-","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117552","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117552.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117552.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117552","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117552/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117552/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117552/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0be87564eaf397319540377a411c9235e3992500","number":117552,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix PointLight2D texture filter not respecting NormalMap setting","user":{"login":"wangshucheng","id":10466053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDY2MDUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10466053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng","html_url":"https://github.com/wangshucheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Issue\r\nFixes #76266 - PointLight2D doesn't respect Nearest texture filter for normal-maps or shadows\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\nWhen using PointLight2D with a CanvasTexture containing a NormalMap, setting the texture filter to Nearest had no effect. The lighting still used Linear interpolation, causing incorrect lighting for pixel-art style games.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\nAdded texture_filter support throughout the Light2D rendering pipeline:\r\n- Added texture_filter field to CanvasLight and Light structures\r\n- Implemented canvas_light_set_texture_filter() in RenderingServer\r\n- Added set_texture_filter()/get_texture_filter() API to Light2D\r\n\r\n## Files Changed\r\n- servers/rendering/renderer_canvas_render_rd.h\r\n- servers/rendering/renderer_canvas_render.h\r\n- servers/rendering/rendering_server.h\r\n- servers/rendering/rendering_server_default.h\r\n- servers/rendering/renderer_canvas_cull.h\r\n- servers/rendering/renderer_canvas_cull.cpp\r\n- scene/2d/light_2d.h\r\n- scene/2d/light_2d.cpp\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\nTest scene created: test_scenes/test_pointlight_filter.tscn, unit tests can be added if needed\r\nSupports switching filter modes at runtime (1=Nearest, 2=Linear, 3=Default)\r\n\r\n## Backward Compatibility\r\nDefault value is TEXTURE_FILTER_PARENT_NODE, maintaining existing behavior.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived